{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_20", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_20.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, one would not give you credit for much thought for your wife and children today; if you had had that, you would not have gone and dragged us all into misfortune.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you out of your senses, Katherine!", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Because a man has a wife and children, is he not to be allowed to proclaim the truth-is he not to be allowed to be an actively useful citizen\u2014is he not to be allowed to do a service to his native town!", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, Thomas\u2014in reason.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Just what I say.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Moderation in everything.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "And that is why you wrong us, Mr. Hovstad, in enticing my husband away from his home and making a dupe of him in all this.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "I certainly am making a dupe of no one\u2014", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Making a dupe of me!", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you suppose I should allow myself to be duped!", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "It is just what you do.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "I know quite well you have more brains than anyone in the town, but you are extremely easily duped, Thomas.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "(To Hovstad.)", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Please do realise that he loses his post at the Baths if you print what he has written.", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "What!", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Look here, Doctor!", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (laughing).", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Ha-ha!\u2014just let them try!", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no\u2014they will take good care not to.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "I have got the compact majority behind me, let me tell you!", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is just the worst of it\u2014your having any such horrid thing behind you.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Rubbish, Katherine!\u2014Go home and look after your house and leave me to look after the community.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "How can you be so afraid, when I am so confident and happy?", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks up and down, rubbing his hands.)", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Truth and the People will win the fight, you may be certain!", "para": 12, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "I see the whole of the broad-minded middle class marching like a victorious army\u2014!", "para": 12, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "(Stops beside a chair.)", "para": 12, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "What the deuce is that lying there?", "para": 12, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen Good Lord!", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Ahem!", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Here we have the topmost pinnacle of authority!", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "(Takes the Mayor's official hat carefully between his finger-tips and holds it up in the air.)", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "The Mayor's hat!", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "And here is the staff of office too.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "How in the name of all that's wonderful\u2014?", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, you see\u2014", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I understand.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "He has been here trying to talk you over.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Ha-ha!\u2014he made rather a mistake there!", "para": 19, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "And as soon as he caught sight of me in the printing room.", "para": 19, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "(Bursts out laughing.)", "para": 19, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Did he run away, Mr. Aslaksen?", "para": 19, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (hurriedly).", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, he ran away, Doctor.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Ran away without his stick or his\u2014.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Fiddlesticks!", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter doesn't run away and leave his belongings behind him.", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "But what the deuce have you done with him?", "para": 21, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah!\u2014in there, of course.", "para": 21, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Now you shall see, Katherine!", "para": 21, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Thomas\u2014please don't\u2014!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't be rash, Doctor.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "(DR. STOCKMANN has put on the Mayor's hat and taken his stick in his hand.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "He goes up to the door, opens it, and stands with his hand to his hat at the salute.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "PETER STOCKMANN comes in, red with anger.", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "BILLING follows him.)", "para": 24, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "What does this tomfoolery mean?", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Be respectful, my good Peter.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "I am the chief authority in the town now.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks up and down.)", "para": 26, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (almost in tears).", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Really, Thomas!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann (following him about).", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Give me my hat and stick.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (in the same tone as before).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "If you are chief constable, let me tell you that I am the Mayor\u2014I am the master of the whole town, please understand!", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Take off my hat, I tell you.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Remember it is part of an official uniform.", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Pooh!", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think the newly awakened lionhearted people are going to be frightened by an official hat?", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "There is going to be a revolution in the town tomorrow, let me tell you.", "para": 31, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "You thought you could turn me out; but now I shall turn you out\u2014turn you out of all your various offices.", "para": 31, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think I cannot?", "para": 31, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Listen to me.", "para": 31, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "I have triumphant social forces behind me.", "para": 31, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad and Billing will thunder in the \"People's Messenger,\" and Aslaksen will take the field at the head of the whole Householders' Association\u2014", "para": 31, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "That I won't, Doctor.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course you will\u2014", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah!\u2014may I ask then if Mr. Hovstad intends to join this agitation?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "No, Mr. Mayor.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "No, Mr. Hovstad is not such a fool as to go and ruin his paper and himself for the sake of an imaginary grievance.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (looking round him).", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "What does this mean?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "You have represented your case in a false light, Doctor, and therefore I am unable to give you my support.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "And after what the Mayor was so kind as to tell me just now, I\u2014", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "A false light!", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Leave that part of it to me.", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Only print my article; I am quite capable of defending it.", "para": 40, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not going to print it.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "I cannot and will not and dare not print it.", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "You dare not?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "What nonsense!\u2014you are the editor; and an editor controls his paper, I suppose!", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "No, it is the subscribers, Doctor.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 131, "kind": "action", "text": "Fortunately, yes.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}